  EXACT  alpha_upper = (alpha_b + phi)/(1 + phi), 2 parameters: 0 usable cell(s) against 2 parameters: a fit that cannot leave a residual cannot test the model it fits, so nothing is reported rather than a number with no degrees of freedom behind it
