  RAW3   alpha = (alpha_b + phi)/(1 + phi + delta), delta FITTED -- cross-check only, never gated: 0 usable cell(s) against 3 parameters: a fit that cannot leave a residual cannot test the model it fits, so nothing is reported rather than a number with no degrees of freedom behind it
